:name: Generic authorized firmware boot trace
:description: Replace every placeholder and review the target map before running

# This template intentionally contains no target-specific addresses.
using sysbus
mach create "bench"

# Replace with the platform description that matches the authorized target.
machine LoadPlatformDescription @<PLATFORM.repl>

# Replace CPU name and firmware path/load address as required by the target.
sysbus LoadBinary @<FIRMWARE.bin> <LOAD_ADDRESS>

# Replace these only after validating the architecture and reset state.
<CPU_NAME> SP <INITIAL_SP>
<CPU_NAME> PC <INITIAL_PC>

# Configure logging/tracing with commands supported by your Renode version.
# Keep the first run hook-free and bound execution with a reviewed duration.
start
emulation RunFor "<DURATION>"
pause
quit
